NO GAME CONTENT IS DISTRIBUTED HERE
-----------------------------------
This repository contains only:
  - patch scripts (tools/)
  - eight cameo icons drawn for the support powers and the beacon (cameos/)
  - MOAutoRepair, a small Syringe plugin written for this project, as source
    and as a build (tools/autorepair/)
  - documentation (README.md, README.zh-CN.md, docs/)

The patcher reads Mental Omega's pristine data out of the mix files inside
YOUR OWN installation, applies its changes, and writes the result back into
YOUR OWN installation. Nothing is redistributed.

OPTIONAL PARTS FROM OTHER MODS
------------------------------
Some optional features are built only from YOUR OWN copies of other mods,
read at patch time. None of their files are in this repository:
  - Phobos and SyringeEx (GPL-3.0, the Phobos team), as shipped in
    "企鹅的心灵终结 v1.1"
  - 12 skirmish maps from "企鹅的心灵终结 v1.1", property of its authors
  - character infantry from "东方秽浪港 ~ Ambitions Behind Corpse.",
    property of its authors

Mental Omega's readme asks that it not be re-uploaded without the team's
explicit permission. Please obtain the game only from https://mentalomega.com

OFFLINE USE ONLY
----------------
This patch modifies rulesmo.ini and therefore desynchronises online play.
Do NOT use it on CnCNet, on LAN, or in any game with other people.
It exists for players stuck on a campaign mission, and for players who have
nobody to play the co-op missions with.

If the Mental Omega team wants this repository taken down, it will be.
